    "created_at": "2018-10-08T15:10:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-10-08T15:10:12Z",
    "body": "Any update on this? WebKit recently started treating noopener differently than other booleans (https://trac.webkit.org/changeset/236802) in order to pass WPT tests. If the spec / WPT tests gets updated, I am happy to revert this change though. As I mentioned early, I'd prefer if all booleans were treated the same way.",
